{
 "__doc__": [
  "docs/PF_CAPTURE_CORPUS.json - the project's SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for WHICH capture files are evidence.",
  "ทะเบียนหลักฐาน capture ของโปรเจกต์ - 'ไฟล์ไหนนับเป็นหลักฐาน' ต้องมาจากไฟล์นี้ที่เดียว ห้ามสแกนไดเรกทอรีเอาเอง",
  "",
  "(1) WHAT THIS FILE IS / ไฟล์นี้คืออะไร",
  "    Every archived capture that a verifier, report or test is allowed to quote is listed here by",
  "    exact path, size and sha256.  A tool that needs 'the corpus' must read THIS file through",
  "    tools/pf_capture_corpus.py.  It must NOT call glob() on a capture directory.",
  "    ทุกเครื่องมือที่ต้องใช้ชุด capture ให้อ่านไฟล์นี้ ห้าม glob ไดเรกทอรีเองอีก",
  "",
  "(2) WHY / ทำไมต้องมีไฟล์นี้ (CORPUS-PIN-001, รอบ 82)",
  "    Verifiers used to answer 'which captures may I quote?' with a directory scan, then pin the",
  "    resulting NUMBER into a published report.  Three holes, all of which we walked into:",
  "",
  "    (a) A SCAN HAS NO EXPECTATION.  On 2026-08-19 a headless replay job booted the server with no",
  "        --capture-root from the repository root.  The frozen snapshot builds its capture directory",
  "        from a RELATIVE path (current/pf_login_game_server_v141.py:7867 -> Path('capture_v141')),",
  "        so live captures landed inside the golden corpus and grew it 69 -> 72.  capture_v141/ is",
  "        git-ignored (.gitignore:157, '**/capture*/'), so git status stayed clean and the v141 hash",
  "        guard stayed green - the v141 FILE really was untouched, the corpus beside it was not.",
  "        The only thing in the entire gate that noticed was a count pinned by an unrelated",
  "        milestone, and it was noticed by accident.  A scan cannot distinguish 'the corpus' from",
  "        'the corpus plus whatever else is sitting in that folder'.",
  "        การสแกนไดเรกทอรีไม่มี 'ความคาดหวัง' - ไฟล์แปลกปลอมงอกแล้วตัวเลขเลื่อนเงียบ",
  "",
  "    (b) A GLOB DOES NOT KNOW WHICH FILES HOLD STILL.  'GAME_*.txt' also matched GAME_LIVE.txt and",
  "        GAME_EVENTS_LIVE.txt, which the server OVERWRITES IN PLACE on every run (v141:7372-7373).",
  "        Two of the 69 files in the published denominator were mutable scratch files.  See the",
  "        'excluded' object of each set: files matched by the pattern that are deliberately not",
  "        evidence are listed there BY NAME, with the reason, so that excluding them is a recorded",
  "        decision instead of a silent filter buried in a tool.",
  "",
  "    (c) COUNTS ARE NOT CONTENT.  A correct file count still says nothing about whether a capture",
  "        holds the bytes a report quotes.  Every entry here carries size + sha256.",
  "",
  "(3) WHAT A VERIFIER GETS / เครื่องมือได้อะไรจากไฟล์นี้",
  "    resolve(set)          -> the pinned paths, proving each exists and is byte-identical",
  "    assert_no_strays(set) -> proves the directory holds NO capture outside the pinned set.",
  "                             This is the guard that turns the incident in (2a) from an accidental",
  "                             discovery into an immediate red.",
  "    Both live in tools/pf_capture_corpus.py; tests/test_capture_corpus.py enforces them.",
  "",
  "(4) WHY THE TABLE LIVES IN docs/ / ทำไมเก็บไว้ใน docs/",
  "    The capture directories themselves are git-ignored and always will be - they are bulky and",
  "    they are written by tooling.  /docs/ is allow-listed (.gitignore:87-88), so this file is the",
  "    one part of the evidence story that git can actually see and diff.  If the corpus changes,",
  "    THIS FILE has to change in a commit, in front of a human.",
  "",
  "(5) HOW TO ADMIT NEW EVIDENCE / จะเพิ่มหลักฐานใหม่ทำยังไง",
  "    Adding a capture is a DELIBERATE act, never a side effect of running something.",
  "      1. Confirm the file is archived evidence, not a live/scratch file, and that it was produced",
  "         on purpose (a job that ran with an explicit --capture-root OUTSIDE the repository).",
  "      2. python3 tools/pf_capture_corpus.py --regenerate",
  "      3. Read the diff.  Every added line must be a file you meant to add.  If a file you did not",
  "         expect appears, that is the bug - do not regenerate it away.",
  "      4. Any report that pins a count over the affected set must be re-measured and its .manifest",
  "         re-hashed in the same commit.",
  "    ห้ามรัน --regenerate เพื่อ 'ทำให้เทสเขียว' - ถ้าเทสแดงแปลว่ามีไฟล์ที่ไม่ควรอยู่ ให้ไปแก้ที่ต้นเหตุ",
  "",
  "(6) THE RULE THAT PREVENTS THE NEXT ONE / กติกาที่กันไม่ให้เกิดซ้ำ",
  "    Every script that boots a server MUST pass an explicit --capture-root that resolves OUTSIDE",
  "    the repository (round 81).  This table is the second line of defence, not the first.",
  "",
  "(7) SCOPE / สิ่งที่ไฟล์นี้ยังไม่ครอบคลุม",
  "    Only the two sets below are pinned so far.  tools/pf_teleportcheck_0x4477_static.py reads a",
  "    capture directory that lives OUTSIDE the git worktree entirely, and",
  "    tools/pf_vital_id_resolve_static.py used to scan capture_v141 with a relative default path;",
  "    the survey of all 13 directory-scan sites is in",
  "    reports/PF_CORPUS_PIN001_DIRECTORY_SCAN_SURVEY_20260819.md."
 ],
